# Bike Sales Dashboard 🚴

## Project Overview
This project analyzes customer bike purchase behavior using Excel.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Slicers
- Dashboard Design

## Key Insights
- Higher-income customers are more likely to purchase bikes.
- The 31–55 age group has the highest purchase rate.
- Customers with shorter commute distances show higher bike adoption.
- Interactive slicers allow filtering by marital status, education, and region.

